      <p>Publish the map from stage 02. Keep this build throughout the course so you can inspect every topic, link, and navigation change as you make it.</p>
      <p><strong>You need:</strong> stage 02 complete. <strong>Time:</strong> about 10 minutes.</p>
      <h2 id="define-the-deliverable" class="group scroll-mt-20">Define the deliverable<a href="#define-the-deliverable" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
      <p>A deliverable names a map, a transformation, and an output folder. Define one deliverable, named <code>full</code>, for the whole guide:</p>
      <ol>
      <li>Choose <strong>Project</strong> &gt; <strong>Project Tools</strong> &gt; <strong>Manage Deliverables...</strong>. The table is empty.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Add...</strong>.</li>
      <li>
      Enter these values:
      <Table class="my-4">
      <TableHeader>
      <TableRow>
      <TableHead>Field</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Value</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
